i></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white/90\">Incorporation</h3><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/incorporation\">Start Company</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/incorporation/states\">State Comparison</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/dashboard\">Dashboard</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 border-t border-white/15 pt-8 text-xs text-white/50 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p>© 2026 Wolfitpark. All rights reserved.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/terms\">Terms</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/refund\">Refunds</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/shipping\">Shipping</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/cookies\">Cookies</a></div></div></div></div></footer></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Wolfitpark\",\"url\":\"https://wolfitpark.online\",\"email\":\"support@wolfitpark.online\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"30 N Gould St\",\"addressLocality\":\"Sheridan\",\"addressRegion\":\"WY\",\"postalCode\":\"82801\",\"addressCountry\":\"US\"},\"sameAs\":[]}</script><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0tp6kbpf5uu08.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><section class=\"section-pad\"><div class=\"container-site max-w-4xl\"><span data-slot=\"badge\" data-variant=\"outline\" class=\"group/badge inline-flex h-5 w-fit shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 overflow-hidden rounded-4xl border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;&gt;svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3! border-border text-foreground [a]:hover:bg-muted [a]:hover:text-muted-foreground mb-4\">Legal</span><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl\">Accessibility Statement</h1><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Last updated: <!-- -->July 25, 2026</p><div class=\"mt-12 space-y-10\"><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">1. Commitment</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Wolfitpark LLC is committed to ensuring digital accessibility for all users, including individuals with disabilities. We continuously work to improve the accessibility and usability of our website and services. We believe everyone should be able to access and benefit from our platform regardless of ability.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">2. Standards</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We strive to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA standards published by the World Wide Web Consortium (W3C). These guidelines outline best practices for making web content accessible to users with various disabilities including visual, auditory, physical, speech, cognitive, and neurological disabilities.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">3. Accessibility Features</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Our website includes the following accessibility features: (a) Keyboard navigation that is logical and consistent; (b) Screen reader compatibility with proper ARIA labels and semantic HTML structure; (c) Sufficient color contrast ratios meeting WCAG AA standards; (d) Resizable text up to 200% without loss of functionality; (e) Alternative text for meaningful images; (f) Descriptive link text — no &#x27;click here&#x27; links; (g) Focus indicators for keyboard navigation; (h) Skip navigation links to bypass repeated content; (i) Captions and transcripts for video content where applicable.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">4. Ongoing Efforts</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We employ the following practices to maintain and improve accessibility: (a) Regular automated accessibility audits using industry-standard tools; (b) Periodic manual testing by users with assistive technologies; (c) Accessibility considerations integrated into our design and development workflow; (d) Staff training on inclusive design and accessibility best practices; (e) Third-party accessibility audits conducted annually.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">5. Known Limitations</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We are actively working to address the following known limitations: (a) Some third-party embedded content may not be fully accessible; (b) Some older PDF documents may not be fully screen-reader compatible. If you encounter barriers, please notify us so we can prioritize fixes.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">6. Third-Party Content</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Our website may link to or embed content from third-party platforms. We cannot guarantee the accessibility of third-party content. We encourage third-party providers to maintain accessible practices.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">7. Feedback and Contact</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We welcome feedback on the accessibility of our website and services. If you encounter accessibility barriers, need assistance accessing any content, or wish to report an issue, please contact us: Email: accessibility@wolfitpark.online. Phone: +1 (307) 555-0199. We will make every reasonable effort to provide the information or service in an accessible format.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">8. Accommodation Request</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">If you require a reasonable accommodation to access our services, please contact us. We will work with you to identify and provide an appropriate accommodation in a timely manner.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">9. Policy Updates</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We review and update this Accessibility Statement at least annually or when significant changes are made to our website or accessibility practices.</p></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNode&&e.parentNode.removeChild(e);var f=c.parentNode;if(f){var g=c.previousSibling,h=0;do{if(c&&8===c.nodeType){var d=c.data;if(\"/$\"===d||\"/&\"===d)if(0===h)break;else h--;else\"$\"!==d&&\"$?\"!==d&&\"$~\"!==d&&\"$!\"!==d&&\"&\"!==d||h++}d=c.nextSibling;f.removeChild(c);c=d}while(c);for(;e.firstChild;)f.insertBefore(e.firstChild,c);g.data=\"$\";g._reactRetry&&requestAnimationFrame(g._reactRetry)}}a.length=0};\n$RC=function(a,b){if(b=document.getElementById(b))(a=document.getElementById(a))?(a.previousSibling.data=\"$~\",$RB.push(a,b),2===$RB.length&&(\"number\"!==typeof $RT?requestAnimationFrame($RV.bind(null,$RB)):(a=performance.now(),setTimeout($RV.bind(null,$RB),2300>a&&2E3<a?2300-a:$RT+300-a)))):b.parentNode.removeChild(b)};$RC(\"B:0\",\"S:0\")</script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:I[12224,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0w2c.i2ky0ich.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0anfux3ged1uf.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/09l_6s1m2kd2f.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/02b7ej9gu8jmt.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunk